diff --git a/docs/docker-deployment.md b/docs/docker-deployment.md
index f6eca78..3150d56 100644
--- a/docs/docker-deployment.md
+++ b/docs/docker-deployment.md
@@ -157,3 +157,17 @@ services:
 volumes:
   fizzy:
 ```
+
+#### Web push notifications
+
+Set `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` on both the web app and its background
+job workers to enable browser push notifications. Ops should provide a persistent
+VAPID key pair; do not generate a new pair on every deploy. The private key is a
+secret and must never be exposed to browsers. `BASE_URL` should be your instance's
+public HTTPS URL and is used as the VAPID contact URI.
+
+Users opt in from **Notification Settings → Push Notifications** on each phone or
+desktop. Push requires HTTPS (or localhost for development) and browser permission.
+On iOS, users must first install Fizzy on their Home Screen; the settings page
+includes installation and blocked-notification help. Without both VAPID keys,
+push is disabled and tray and email notifications continue working normally.
